        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>36 Inch Rodas Door Handle Brushed Stainless Steel</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEasy to install, the modern Rodas 36 Inch Door Pull has a Brushed Stainless Steel finish. That means it not only looks good, it is easy to take care of. The 36 Inch Rodas Door Handle Brushed Stainless Steel is available in thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, and back to back mounting. The Rodas Door Pull has 36 inch mounting centers and a 36-3/4 inch overall length. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNeed a different size?  <a href=\"/products/rodas-24-inch-door-pull-in-brushed-stainless-steel\"><b>24 Rodas Inch Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/rodas-48-inch-door-pull-in-brushed-stainless-steel\"><b>48 Rodas Inch Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/rodas-60-inch-door-pull-in-brushed-stainless-steel\"><b>60\" Rodas Inch Door Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/rodas-72-inch-door-pull-in-brushed-stainless-steel\"><b>72\" Rodas Inch Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rectangular Doorware Designs RTMPULL36-630:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Grade Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 36-3/4\" (934mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 36\" (9140mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Grip Width: 1-1/2\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 3\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed on fiberglass, wood, glass, and metal doors.\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-RTMPULL36-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262424\"><b>DWD-RTMPULL36 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Rodas 36 Inch Door Pull in Brushed Stainless Steel",
